# Response Contract (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-response-contract.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-response-contract.md)

## Principle

Not a chatbot, summarizer, or medical advice engine. Optimize for caregiver orientation — never “good AI conversation.”

## Pipeline (all inputs)

Evidence Understanding → Care Reality → Situation Relationship Engine → **Response Contract**

Source changes. Philosophy does not. Voice = FUTURE (same contract later).

## Fields (order)

1. What is happening (Care Reality; **internal** Known/Likely/Unknown — never panel labels; see ADR-024)  
2. What matters now (one primary priority)  
3. What to ask next (usually 1; max 1–3; no interview)  
4. Risk level (Low/Medium/High — evidence only)  
5. What can wait  
6. Follow-up items (continuity memory — not tasks)

## Never

Hardcoded scenario templates · fabricated context · therapy empathy · AI product language · advice/diagnosis · fake certainty

## Success

*“I understand this situation better.”* — not *“The AI summarized my note.”*
